   "text": "Keele University International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKeele University International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nKeele University International College provides students with flexible entry points to support you in your journey to a degree from Keele University in the UK.The College offers Foundation, International Year One and Pre-Master’s programmes designed to help students build the skills, confidence and support network needed to thrive in your undergraduate or postgraduate degree. Pre-sessional English courses are also available for students who need additional language support before beginning your academic journey.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:02\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:06\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £33,176.25\nMin: £12,757.50\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n13%\n1,000 of 8,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1949\nCampus(es)\nStaffordshire\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-kdd6m-kbl4\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
